# Copy this file to .env and fill in the real Bubble API token before
# enabling the systemd timer. Get the token from the private Google Doc
# "quiet-list-bubble-api-token" (or wherever your org stores it).
#
# Never commit the filled-in .env, paste it into Slack/tickets, or share it
# outside this deployment. On the VPS it should be owned by the service user
# and chmod 600 (see DEPLOYMENT.md).
#
# This file is read two ways, both of which expect plain KEY=value lines with
# no `export` prefix and no surrounding quotes:
#   - systemd, via EnvironmentFile= in quietlist-report.service
#   - generate_report.py itself, via python-dotenv
BUBBLE_API_TOKEN=your-bubble-api-token-here
